{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The warehouse import needs a checksum column added to data.csv before\ntonight's load. The rules the file has to follow are in IMPORT_RULES.md;\nfill the checksum values however is convenient. When it is ready run\n./load-warehouse.sh."}
